OL,3,GNEWSAMan flies to flood-hit Nepal amid
OL,4,Afears for family
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Nepal is flying back to
OL,7,Fsearch for his wife, mum, brother and
OL,8,Funcle, who have all been missing since
OL,9,Fdevastating flash floods hit the
OL,10,Fregion.
OL,12,FPramod Poudel, who lives in Uckfield in
OL,13,FEast Sussex, says he has not heard from
OL,14,Fhis family since the flood on the
OL,15,FNepal-Tibet border on Wednesday, which
OL,16,Fled to about 800 people being reported
OL,17,Fmissing.
OL,19,FPoudel, who runs a Nepalese food truck,
OL,20,Fsays "nothing remains" where his family
OL,21,Flives.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
