OL,3,GNEWSAMan flies to flood-hit Nepal amid
OL,4,Afears for family
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a very, very difficult time for
OL,7,Fme and for my family and my country at
OL,8,Fthis moment, but obviously I have to go
OL,9,Fand see what's happening there," he
OL,10,Ftold BBC Radio Sussex.
